{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 13, :comments ["If a man borrows — an animal, to do his work with it." "Or it is broken, or dies — it was torn or it died." "Its owner is not with it — at the work of that animal, by the plain sense. And according to the derash of the Sages: even at other work, if he is with him at labor, the borrower is exempt from 'or it is broken or dies.'"], :book :exodus, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:42:34.908050034Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}